'' linux-arm64 LINKS LIKE linux-x86_64 since its runtime exists (docs/tiko-linux-arm64 L2,
'' D-L2-4, which dropped L1's TKO0992 refusal): the ELF line, and the same refusal when a
'' library path lacks fbrt0.o -- see no-fbrt0.test, which this mirrors.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target linux-arm64 tests/driver/src/no-fbrt0.bas -o tests/driver/nofbrt0-a64.out
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=tests/driver
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 5
'' EXPECT-OUT: error TKO0111: no usable toolchain: the runtime's startup object (fbrt0.o) is on no library path
'' EXPECT-NO-FILE: tests/driver/nofbrt0-a64.out
